            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 134508,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>HTML ci permette anche di aggiungere immagini a una pagina web.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   img {&#xA;    border: solid gray 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    width: 250px;&#xA;    margin: auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Photography competition winner&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img&#xA;   style=&quot;width: 200px;&quot; src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/fox.png&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Images",
            "id": 134494,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere <strong>immagini</strong> a una pagina web, iniziamo con il tag <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Drawing of \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Earthrise\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Images",
            "id": 134495,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proprio come <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> è un <strong>empty tag</strong>. Significa che non ha un tag di chiusura.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Drawing of \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Earthrise\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;img&gt;&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>img</code> e infine <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Images",
            "id": 134496,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il tag <code>img</code> ha bisogno dell'attributo <code>src</code> per visualizzare un'immagine. <code>src</code> sta per source.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Drawing of \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Earthrise\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/earth.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>src</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/earth.png\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
