          {
            "title": "Width",
            "id": 134497,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare gli attributi per modificare le dimensioni delle immagini. Gli attributi <code>width</code> e <code>height</code> usano i pixel come unità di misura predefinita.</p><p>I pixel sono minuscoli punti che compongono ciò che vedi sullo schermo.<br />Imposta la larghezza di questa immagine su <code>width = \"100\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/earth.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;100&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>width</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"100\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Height",
            "id": 134498,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>E l'attributo <code>height</code> regola l'<strong>altezza</strong> di un'immagine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/earth.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
